{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% block title %}About · {{ site.publication }}{% endblock %}
{% block main %}
<header class="mast">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p class="lede">{{ site.publication }} is a weekly newspaper for one reader who left social media but still wants to know what the people they trust are reading and arguing about.</p>
</header>
<div class="prose">
<h2>What it is</h2>
<p>One edition a week, about fifteen items, and then it stops: <em>That is all for this week.</em> It covers AI safety and AI policy first, and rationalist, post-rationalist and contemplative writing second.</p>
<p>Every item says why it is here and who pointed at it. News is compressed. Essays get a reason to read and a reading time, never a summary. There are no likes, no counts and no feed to scroll.</p>
<h2>How it is made</h2>
<ol>
  <li>A program collects the week's posts from the reader's Substack subscriptions, three friends, the people whose likes count as recommendations, and the top posts on LessWrong.</li>
  <li>An AI model (Claude, by Anthropic) reads those candidates and drafts the edition. It can only link to things that were collected; an automatic check rejects anything else.</li>
  <li>A person reads the draft, edits it, and approves it. Nothing is published without that.</li>
</ol>
<p>The colophon at the end of each edition says what was checked, what failed, and what the edition cannot see.</p>
<h2>Quotes and links</h2>
<p>Every item links to the original. Quotes are short. If you wrote something that appears here and want it changed or removed, say so below.</p>
<h2>Feedback</h2>
{% if site.feedback_form_action %}
<form class="feedback" method="post" action="{{ site.feedback_form_action }}">
  <label for="msg">Feedback, in words</label>
  <textarea id="msg" name="message" rows="5" required></textarea>
  <label for="from">Your email (optional, if you want a reply)</label>
  <input id="from" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email">
  <button type="submit">Send</button>
</form>
{% else %}
<p>A feedback form is coming. Feedback here is given in words, not buttons.</p>
{% endif %}
<h2>Privacy</h2>
<p>This site sets no cookies, runs no scripts and loads nothing from other servers. Its fonts are served from this site.</p>
</div>
{% endblock %}
